msgctxt "Addons::description::exikane_changes"
msgid "Custom changes for partner flows"
msgstr ""
"UI tweaks module:\n"
"1. Guest and partner banners on storefront pages.\n"
"2. Login, registration, and password visibility UX improvements.\n"
"3. Theme-specific overrides for ABT Unitheme2.\n"
"4. Small storefront and backend interface customizations."

